    "detailed_description": "&quot;Keyboard Maestro Voyage&quot; is a music game that simulates realistic performances by using a MIDI keyboard as a controller. Play the keyboard in sync with various flowing notes and experience a real performance.<br><br>[Features]<br>\u25a0 Simple: A classic-style music game that's easy to understand - just play in time with the flowing notes.<br>\u25a0 Tutorial: Even users who are not familiar with the keyboard can learn how to play through the tutorial.<br>\u25a0 Quick: You can choose a song and score and start playing immediately.<br>\u25a0 Casual: You can play for about 2 minutes per song.<br>\u25a0 Step Up: Play songs that match your skill level with nine levels of difficulty.<br>\u25a0 Multiple Parts: Each song has multiple parts.<br>\u25a0 Options: You can choose various options to suit your play style.<br>\u25a0 Assist: Auto play is available for those who just want to practice the keyboard.<br>\u25a0 Realistic Approach: It uses a real MIDI keyboard.<br>\u25a0 Bend: Not only the keyboard but also the operation of pitch bend and modulation are reproduced.<br>\u25a0 All Original Songs: All the songs in this game are 100% original.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688670/extras/5e55d5be58c4dd5b70ba1263c9cdf62f.poster.avif?t=1723999519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688670/extras/5e55d5be58c4dd5b70ba1263c9cdf62f.webm?t=1723999519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>[Terms]<br>\u25a0 MIDI Keyboard: A keyboard controller for inputting MIDI information into a PC or other instruments.<br>\u25a0 Pitch Bend: A feature commonly found in synthesizers, etc., which allows you to move the pitch of the sound up and down during performance.<br>\u25a0 Modulation: A feature commonly found in synthesizers, etc., which allows you to sway (vibrate) the sound during performance.",
